{"title": "Multiattack: Wounded (Werewolf)", "pageid": 27903, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Wounded_(Werewolf)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Wounded</b> is a passive feature of a <a href=\"/wiki/Werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf\">Werewolf</a> that lets them attack multiple times if its target is Prone or <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a> are less than 60%.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Werewolf)\" title=\"Multiattack (Werewolf)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Werewolf)\" title=\"Multiattack (Werewolf)\">Multiattack</a> if the target is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> or if its <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a> are at 60% or less. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blaise_Hhune\" title=\"Blaise Hhune\">Blaise Hhune</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duver_Rillyn\" title=\"Duver Rillyn\">Duver Rillyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gheris_Hhune\" title=\"Gheris Hhune\">Gheris Hhune</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lurianna_Sauvage\" title=\"Lurianna Sauvage\">Lurianna Sauvage</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Predator_Werewolf\" title=\"Predator Werewolf\">Predator Werewolf</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf\">Werewolf</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042811\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 916/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5057/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2549/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 499/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643719/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.999      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.999      1 -total\n 32.79%   10.165      2 Template:Icon_link\n 31.55%    9.779      2 Template:Icon_text\n 29.89%    9.266      1 Template:SAI\n 26.75%    8.292      4 Template:Trim\n 21.37%    6.624      2 Template:Ifempty\n 18.27%    5.662      1 Template:Cond\n 11.34%    3.514      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.40%    3.224      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27903-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715042811 and revision id 168504. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}